{"id":19,"slug":"19-header-footer-nav-main-aside-dung-khi-nao","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Semantic","level":"beginner","question_vi":"`<header>`, `<footer>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<aside>` dùng khi nào?","question_en":"When should you use `<header>`, `<footer>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<aside>`?","answer_vi":"Năm thẻ landmark, mỗi thẻ trả lời một câu hỏi \"khối này đóng vai gì trong trang\":\n\n```html\n<body>\n  <header>                  <!-- giới thiệu / brand / search -->\n    <nav>...</nav>          <!-- điều hướng chính -->\n  </header>\n\n  <main>                    <!-- nội dung chính, DUY NHẤT 1 trên trang -->\n    <article>\n      <header>...</header>  <!-- header cấp article, hợp lệ -->\n      <p>...</p>\n      <footer>...</footer>\n    </article>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside>...</aside>        <!-- liên quan gián tiếp: sidebar, bài liên quan -->\n  <footer>...</footer>      <!-- copyright, liên hệ -->\n</body>\n```\n\n| Thẻ | Số lần / trang | Screen reader |\n|---|---|---|\n| `<main>` | **đúng 1** | đích của \"skip to content\" |\n| `<nav>` | nhiều | liệt kê trong danh sách landmark |\n| `<header>` / `<footer>` | nhiều (mỗi article một cái) | banner / contentinfo khi ở cấp trang |\n| `<aside>` | nhiều | complementary |\n\n**Lưu ý:** `<header>`/`<footer>` chỉ được tính là landmark `banner`/`contentinfo` khi nằm **trực tiếp trong `<body>`**. Đặt trong `<article>` thì mất vai trò đó — đúng theo spec, không phải lỗi","answer_en":"Five landmark elements, each answering \"what role does this block play\":\n\n```html\n<body>\n  <header>                  <!-- intro / brand / search -->\n    <nav>...</nav>          <!-- primary navigation -->\n  </header>\n\n  <main>                    <!-- primary content, EXACTLY one per page -->\n    <article>\n      <header>...</header>  <!-- article-level header, perfectly valid -->\n      <p>...</p>\n      <footer>...</footer>\n    </article>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside>...</aside>        <!-- indirectly related: sidebar, related posts -->\n  <footer>...</footer>      <!-- copyright, contact -->\n</body>\n```\n\n| Element | Per page | Screen reader |\n|---|---|---|\n| `<main>` | **exactly 1** | target of \"skip to content\" |\n| `<nav>` | many | listed among landmarks |\n| `<header>` / `<footer>` | many (one per article) | banner / contentinfo at page level |\n| `<aside>` | many | complementary |\n\n**Note:** `<header>`/`<footer>` only map to the `banner`/`contentinfo` landmarks when they are **direct children of `<body>`**. Inside an `<article>` they lose that role — by design, not a bug","answer_html_vi":"<p>Năm thẻ landmark, mỗi thẻ trả lời một câu hỏi \"khối này đóng vai gì trong trang\":</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;body&gt;\n  &lt;header&gt;                  &lt;!-- giới thiệu / brand / search --&gt;\n    &lt;nav&gt;...&lt;/nav&gt;          &lt;!-- điều hướng chính --&gt;\n  &lt;/header&gt;\n\n  &lt;main&gt;                    &lt;!-- nội dung chính, DUY NHẤT 1 trên trang --&gt;\n    &lt;article&gt;\n      &lt;header&gt;...&lt;/header&gt;  &lt;!-- header cấp article, hợp lệ --&gt;\n      &lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;footer&gt;...&lt;/footer&gt;\n    &lt;/article&gt;\n  &lt;/main&gt;\n\n  &lt;aside&gt;...&lt;/aside&gt;        &lt;!-- liên quan gián tiếp: sidebar, bài liên quan --&gt;\n  &lt;footer&gt;...&lt;/footer&gt;      &lt;!-- copyright, liên hệ --&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>                  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- giới thiệu / brand / search --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span>&gt;</span>          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- điều hướng chính --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">main</span>&gt;</span>                    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- nội dung chính, DUY NHẤT 1 trên trang --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- header cấp article, hợp lệ --&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">main</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">aside</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">aside</span>&gt;</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- liên quan gián tiếp: sidebar, bài liên quan --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- copyright, liên hệ --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Thẻ</th><th>Số lần / trang</th><th>Screen reader</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>&lt;main&gt;</code></td><td><strong>đúng 1</strong></td><td>đích của \"skip to content\"</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;nav&gt;</code></td><td>nhiều</td><td>liệt kê trong danh sách landmark</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;header&gt;</code> / <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code></td><td>nhiều (mỗi article một cái)</td><td>banner / contentinfo khi ở cấp trang</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;aside&gt;</code></td><td>nhiều</td><td>complementary</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>/<code>&lt;footer&gt;</code> chỉ được tính là landmark <code>banner</code>/<code>contentinfo</code> khi nằm <strong>trực tiếp trong <code>&lt;body&gt;</code></strong>. Đặt trong <code>&lt;article&gt;</code> thì mất vai trò đó — đúng theo spec, không phải lỗi.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Five landmark elements, each answering \"what role does this block play\":</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;body&gt;\n  &lt;header&gt;                  &lt;!-- intro / brand / search --&gt;\n    &lt;nav&gt;...&lt;/nav&gt;          &lt;!-- primary navigation --&gt;\n  &lt;/header&gt;\n\n  &lt;main&gt;                    &lt;!-- primary content, EXACTLY one per page --&gt;\n    &lt;article&gt;\n      &lt;header&gt;...&lt;/header&gt;  &lt;!-- article-level header, perfectly valid --&gt;\n      &lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;footer&gt;...&lt;/footer&gt;\n    &lt;/article&gt;\n  &lt;/main&gt;\n\n  &lt;aside&gt;...&lt;/aside&gt;        &lt;!-- indirectly related: sidebar, related posts --&gt;\n  &lt;footer&gt;...&lt;/footer&gt;      &lt;!-- copyright, contact --&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>                  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- intro / brand / search --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span>&gt;</span>          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- primary navigation --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">main</span>&gt;</span>                    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- primary content, EXACTLY one per page --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- article-level header, perfectly valid --&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">main</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">aside</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">aside</span>&gt;</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- indirectly related: sidebar, related posts --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- copyright, contact --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Per page</th><th>Screen reader</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>&lt;main&gt;</code></td><td><strong>exactly 1</strong></td><td>target of \"skip to content\"</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;nav&gt;</code></td><td>many</td><td>listed among landmarks</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;header&gt;</code> / <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code></td><td>many (one per article)</td><td>banner / contentinfo at page level</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;aside&gt;</code></td><td>many</td><td>complementary</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Note:</strong> <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>/<code>&lt;footer&gt;</code> only map to the <code>banner</code>/<code>contentinfo</code> landmarks when they are <strong>direct children of <code>&lt;body&gt;</code></strong>. Inside an <code>&lt;article&gt;</code> they lose that role — by design, not a bug.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Structuring documents","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content/Structuring_documents"},{"label":"W3C — ARIA landmark roles","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/practices/landmark-regions/"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/17-su-khac-biet-giua-div-va-section-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa `<div>` và `<section>` là gì?"},{"url":"/q/18-article-va-section-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`<article>` và `<section>` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/20-figure-va-figcaption-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"`<figure>` và `<figcaption>` dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/21-mark-strong-em-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`<mark>`, `<strong>`, `<em>` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/22-the-time-duoc-su-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Thẻ `<time>` được sử dụng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/23-semantic-html-anh-huong-seo-nhu-the-nao","title":"Semantic HTML ảnh hưởng SEO như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/24-khi-nao-dung-dl-dt-dd","title":"Khi nào dùng `<dl>`, `<dt>`, `<dd>`?"}]}